# Sanctioned swatches — one swatch name per line.
# Convention: this file lives NEXT TO the build dir, never inside it, so it stays
# out of the packed .idml. Discovery order: <build>.swatches, then any *.swatches
# in the build's parent (manuals/<product>/<product>.swatches), then the kit's.
# Override with --swatches PATH.
#
#  * These names are KEPT by prune_swatches.py even if currently unused
#    (the sanctioned palette a manual is allowed to draw from).
#  * validate_idml.py FLAGS any applied color whose name is not in this list
#    (structural None / Paper / Registration / $ID-managed are always allowed).
#    A mixed ink built only from listed inks counts as listed.
#
# DM32 palette: Black + up to 3 spot colors, never more. Black is mandatory.
Black
PANTONE 292 U
PANTONE 130 U
PANTONE Warm Gray 1 U
